<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #0A0A0A; line-height: 1.5;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 20px;">Confirm your email address</h1>

    <p>Welcome to Sigil. Please confirm your email address to activate your account.</p>

    <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
        <a href="{{ signedUrl }}"
           style="display: inline-block; background: #1E3A8A; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none;
                  padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 600;">
            Confirm my email
        </a>
    </p>

    <p style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 13px;">
        This link expires in {{ expiresAtMessageKey|trans(expiresAtMessageData, 'VerifyEmailBundle') }}.
        If you did not create a Sigil account, you can ignore this message.
    </p>

    <p style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 13px;">
        If the button does not work, copy and paste this URL into your browser:<br>
        <span style="word-break: break-all;">{{ signedUrl }}</span>
    </p>
</body>
</html>
